# Its "Clear + automation knob": CLEAR (D#4) held and a knob turned clears
# that parameter's lane (`aclr 0 0`), and CLEAR's release does not delete
# the clip (no `clipdel`; a CLEAR tap does nothing until stage S9).
--button 0.05:SEQ
--key 0.10:7:100:0.3
--turn 0.20:SELECT:1
--turn 0.25:SELECT:1
--turn 0.30:KNOB3:1
--key 0.50:10:100:0.3
--turn 0.60:KNOB3:1
--button 1.00:PLAY/STOP
